OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested on suspicion of
OL,4,Amurder over missing woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating the disappearance
OL,7,Fof a 39-year-old woman have arrested a
OL,8,F35-year-old man on suspicion of her
OL,9,Fmurder.
OL,11,FCarrie Mullane (Noonan), who is from
OL,12,FLimerick, is known to have travelled to
OL,13,FEnniskillen, County Fermanagh, on 10
OL,14,FOctober.
OL,16,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,17,F(PSNI) said there have been no
OL,18,Fconfirmed sightings of her since that
OL,19,Fdate, and she has not been in touch
OL,20,Fwith family or friends.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
