OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested on suspicion of
OL,4,Amurder over missing woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey added that there is now "serious
OL,7,Fconcern" that Mullane "may have been
OL,8,Fmurdered sometime after her arrival in
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland".
